description:
### <custom data-type="emoji" data-id="id-0">:person_with_crown:</custom> User story

**As** an online store visitor, **I want** to view a neatly organized overview of all blog posts, **so that** I can quickly browse through content, discover topics of interest, and engage more with the brand.

---

| **Page Layout and Structure** Has H1 title and an optional subline The blog overview page must display a grid or list of blog posts. Each blog post preview should include: Featured image (ratio can be chosen by the user and is determined by the blog post featured image) Blog post title Excerpt (summary or first \~100 words) Link to full blog post (`Read More`) There must be the option to display a featured post above the grid Layout options: Grid layout (3 columns) for desktops Stacked layout for mobile viewports (responsive design) content slot after pagination | [basic template](https://www.figma.com/design/iOpGWO38HkhnTYkEeEq8Oz/Laioutr-Basic?node-id=44-112670&t=bEXX3iWukUFWihvM-4) [AMBIENDO page layout](https://www.figma.com/design/gDN7wlDFp5mwXQfRDhotzR/Ambiendo---sunny?node-id=106-21835&t=CXICWc7vpUCFE48F-4)    |
| --- | --- |
| **Pagination or Infinite Scroll** Support for: Pagination  **or** Infinite scroll (load more posts on scroll) | <custom data-type="smartlink" data-id="id-1">https://www.figma.com/design/92moLelAY8lh8mI0rhCGzy/laioutr-UI?node-id=20068-1706</custom>  ![](blob:https://media.staging.atl-paas.net/?type=file&localId=null&id=976d259a-63f6-4015-812e-345a893d3afd&&collection=&height=90&occurrenceKey=null&width=170&__contextId=null&__displayType=null&__external=false&__fileMimeType=null&__fileName=null&__fileSize=null&__mediaTraceId=null&url=null)  |
| **SEO & Accessibility** Use semantic HTML (`<article>`, `<h2>`, `<time>`, etc.) for each post preview. Page should be optimized with appropriate meta tags, structured data for blog posts. Alt text for all featured images. Use ARIA labels for navigation and filter elements. |  |
| **CMS Integration** Blog posts should be dynamically pulled from Shopify's built-in blog engine. Support for multiple blogs (Shopify supports more than one blog per store). Admin should be able to assign featured images, tags, excerpts via the Shopify admin. |  |

### **Acceptance Criteria:**

* example like figma with CMS image block and pagination
* example like figma with CMS image block and infinite scroll 

### **Technical Details:**

_**molecules/PageHeader**_

```
interface PageHeaderProps {
  title : string;
  subline? : string;
}
```

* use `Text` component

_**pages/BlogOverviewPage**_

```
interface SearchResultsPageProps{
  header : ShopHeaderProps;
  breadcrumbs : BreadcrumbsProps;
  pageHeader : pageHeaderProps
  footer : footerProps;
  newsLetterRegisteration: NewsLetterRegisterationProps
  featuredPost? : SectionCmsImageTextProps;
  pagination : {
    currentIndex;
    total;
  }
  blogs: CardProps;
}
```

* use ecommerce-container 
* use `useScroll` from vue use to handle `infiniteScroll`
* seperate the pagination from swiper into a molecule with event handlers with next and prev so you can use in both here and with swiper it will be implemented in `LightBoxModal` ticket 
* create wrapper component for the paginations arrow  
* use `ShopHeader` , `Breadcrumb` , `PageHeader` , `CmsImageText` , `Cards` , `PaginationArrows` , `Footer` , `Newsletterregisteration`
